# Whitelist strategy: ignore everything, then re-include the synchronized support files.
# Runtime state, caches, credentials, plugin deps, and machine-specific config
# (opencode.jsonc / opencode.json) must never be committed. install.ps1 additively
# merges synchronized defaults from templates/opencode.jsonc; machine-local entries
# remain local, with only explicit system migrations updating existing values.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/agents/
!/agents/**
!/skills/
!/skills/**
!/templates/
!/prompts/
!/prompts/**
